{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cm0QYHFRTx1794380039.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近期市場氣氛正面，馬鞍山雲海最新錄本月首宗成交，單位為香海臺2座中層C室，實用面積515平方呎，2房連儲物房間隔，開價約860萬元，議價後以830萬元易手，實用平均呎價16,117元。<br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為換樓客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2018年以1,048萬元購入單位，持貨約8年，是次轉手賬面上蝕218萬元或20.8%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:35:50.217537+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:54:55.032232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:29:14.383117+00:00","content_hash":"e1153dc1d32cbcdadca957dec4ba855ba3c90508dc1c65c824a976ccc19f496a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:35:50.217537+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}